--[[
	NebulaUI  -  Premium Roblox UI library (Luau)
	Version 1.0.0

	Place this file in a ModuleScript named "NebulaUI" (ReplicatedStorage is a good home)
	and require it from a LocalScript.  See Example.client.lua and README.md.

	Architecture (all in this one module, split into clearly marked layers):
		1. Utilities      - Maid (cleanup), New() instance factory, layout helpers
		2. Themes         - colour palettes (Dark / Graphite / Midnight, extendable)
		3. Library core   - theme binding, tweening, flags/config, notifications, window
		4. Components     - Button, Toggle, Slider, Dropdown, Textbox, Keybind, Label,
		                    Paragraph, Divider, ColorPicker (registry: Library.Components)
		5. Section / Tab  - containers that expose the Create* API
		6. Built-in pages - Home dashboard, Settings, About

	Extending: add a function to Library.Components (name -> function(section, opts))
	and every Section automatically gets Section:Create<Name>(opts).
]]

